{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06263","headline":"古游侠呈军中诸将 · 崔颢","name":"古游侠呈军中诸将","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少年负胆气，好勇复知机。\n仗剑出门去，孤城逢合围。\n杀人辽水上，走马渔阳归。\n错落金锁甲，蒙茸貂鼠衣。\n还家行且猎，弓矢速如飞。\n地迥鹰犬疾，草深狐兔肥。\n腰间带两绶，转盼生光辉。\n顾谓今日战，何如随建威。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔颢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06263.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06263","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}